      {
        "body": "Quality stack requires body at least seventy percent of high-low range, favorable close within the final twenty percent, and a break of the previous bar directional extreme. The larger state must complete strictly before the small signal; same-second ambiguity is excluded. L excludes the reversal. The test-labelled April–September 2026 contrasts use saved 95% session-cluster pointwise intervals and do not correct a feature search. The next-bar-close price diagnostic is measured in small-chart product ticks; it is not the colour probability. One-bar snapback compares exactly one opposing prior bar with longer prior runs.",
